<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><ttm:agent type="other" xml:id="v2"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Kali Ma"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Neck Deep"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Life’s Not Out to Get You"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="33933848"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="102948303"/><amll:meta key="spotifyId" value="4HsWOiIPuQ6tCT3suvGWMK"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1716631799"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="USHR21579004"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Fifty-Four54"/></metadata></head><body dur="02:42.450"><div begin="00:20.900" end="02:42.450"><p begin="00:20.900" end="00:25.200" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L0"><span begin="00:20.900" end="00:22.800">Sit still</span> <span begin="00:22.850" end="00:23.150">in</span> <span begin="00:23.200" end="00:23.300">the</span> <span begin="00:23.350" end="00:25.200">cold of February</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">静静坐在二月的寒冷里</span></p><p begin="00:25.250" end="00:29.550" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1"><span begin="00:25.250" end="00:25.700">Hold my</span> <span begin="00:25.710" end="00:26.200">hand in</span> <span begin="00:26.230" end="00:27.450">the cemetery</span> <span begin="00:27.450" end="00:27.800">and you'll</span> <span begin="00:27.900" end="00:29.550">be safe</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">在墓园牵着我的手吧，你会安全的</span></p><p begin="00:30.000" end="00:34.520" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="00:30.000" end="00:30.450">And I</span> <span begin="00:30.500" end="00:30.930">know</span> <span begin="00:31.150" end="00:32.050">that</span> <span begin="00:32.290" end="00:32.690">this is</span> <span begin="00:32.750" end="00:34.520">only temporary</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我知道这一切都只是暂时</span></p><p begin="00:34.520" end="00:39.020" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="00:34.520" end="00:34.980">And I</span> <span begin="00:35.050" end="00:35.740">don't think</span> <span begin="00:35.760" end="00:36.220">that it's</span> <span begin="00:36.220" end="00:36.900">helping</span> <span begin="00:37.000" end="00:39.020">anything</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">可我也不觉得这能改变什么</span></p><p begin="00:39.450" end="00:44.100" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:39.450" end="00:39.900">And it's</span> <span begin="00:39.900" end="00:40.580">all fun</span> <span begin="00:40.580" end="00:41.440">and games</span> <span begin="00:41.440" end="00:42.000">until</span> <span begin="00:42.000" end="00:43.000">someone</span> <span begin="00:43.110" end="00:43.380">gets</span> <span begin="00:43.430" end="00:44.100">fucked up</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">一切在出事前都像场游戏，可最后总会有人被伤得体无完肤</span></p><p begin="00:44.260" end="00:46.150" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:44.260" end="00:44.850">This will</span> <span begin="00:44.930" end="00:45.620">end in</span> <span begin="00:45.670" end="00:46.150">tears</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">结局注定以眼泪收场</span></p><p begin="00:46.200" end="00:49.500" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="00:46.200" end="00:46.810">I could</span> <span begin="00:46.810" end="00:47.730">never</span> <span begin="00:47.730" end="00:48.900">be enough</span> <span begin="00:48.900" end="00:49.500">for you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">因为我永远无法真正让你满足</span></p><p begin="00:49.840" end="00:54.400" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="00:49.840" end="00:50.330">Count my</span> <span begin="00:50.420" end="00:51.925">blessings on one hand</span> <span begin="00:52.150" end="00:53.560">and my curses on</span> <span begin="00:53.600" end="00:54.400">the other</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我一只手数着仅剩的幸运，另一只手数着自己的诅咒</span></p><p begin="00:54.420" end="00:56.850" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="00:54.420" end="00:55.000">I let you</span> <span begin="00:55.000" end="00:55.360">slip</span> <span begin="00:55.360" end="00:55.830">between</span> <span begin="00:55.830" end="00:56.850">my fingers</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我让你从指缝间溜走</span></p><p begin="00:56.870" end="00:58.820" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="00:56.870" end="00:57.600">Hide away</span> <span begin="00:57.600" end="00:58.250">until</span> <span begin="00:58.290" end="00:58.820">the summer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">然后躲起来，直到夏天来临</span></p><p begin="00:58.600" end="01:00.600" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="00:58.600" end="00:59.280">Kali Ma</span> <span begin="00:59.280" end="00:59.610">lean</span> <span begin="00:59.620" end="01:00.600">over me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">迦梨女神，俯身靠近我吧</span></p><p begin="01:00.900" end="01:03.100" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="01:00.900" end="01:01.650">Rip your hand</span> <span begin="01:01.650" end="01:02.470">into my</span> <span begin="01:02.470" end="01:03.100">chest</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">把手伸进我的胸膛</span></p><p begin="01:03.170" end="01:05.750" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="01:03.170" end="01:03.670">Pull out my</span> <span begin="01:03.730" end="01:04.620">beating heart</span> <span begin="01:04.630" end="01:05.750">for the world to see</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">将我仍在跳动的心脏掏出来给全世界看</span></p><p begin="01:05.820" end="01:07.400" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="01:05.820" end="01:06.590">Then send me</span> <span begin="01:06.630" end="01:07.400">down to hell</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">然后把我送下地狱</span></p><p begin="01:07.400" end="01:09.400" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="01:07.400" end="01:08.340">You ignore</span> <span begin="01:08.400" end="01:09.400">my pleas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你无视我的哀求</span></p><p begin="01:09.750" end="01:16.640" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="01:09.750" end="01:10.720">Indiana</span> <span begin="01:10.790" end="01:11.230">couldn't</span> <span begin="01:11.230" end="01:11.950">save me</span> <span begin="01:11.990" end="01:13.270">so I guess</span> <span begin="01:13.270" end="01:14.200"> I'll save</span> <span begin="01:14.280" end="01:16.640">myself</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">连印第安纳都救不了我，所以我想只能由我自己拯救自己了</span></p><p begin="01:26.470" end="01:30.750" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16"><span begin="01:26.470" end="01:27.500">We hopped from bench</span> <span begin="01:27.520" end="01:28.310">to bench</span> <span begin="01:28.450" end="01:30.750">in the middle of our town</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我们在小镇中央，从一张长椅跳到另一张长椅</span></p><p begin="01:30.780" end="01:35.280" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17"><span begin="01:30.780" end="01:31.800">Where the streetlights</span> <span begin="01:31.850" end="01:32.830">hit your eyes</span> <span begin="01:32.830" end="01:33.400">and then</span> <span begin="01:33.400" end="01:34.100">the tears came</span> <span begin="01:34.160" end="01:35.280">falling down</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">街灯映进你的眼睛，接着眼泪便落了下来</span></p><p begin="01:35.780" end="01:39.710" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18"><span begin="01:35.780" end="01:36.350">The love</span> <span begin="01:36.400" end="01:37.650">that you confessed</span> <span begin="01:37.650" end="01:38.250">the product</span> <span begin="01:38.250" end="01:38.830">of your</span> <span begin="01:38.880" end="01:39.710">loneliness</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你口中的爱,不过是孤独催生出的产物</span></p><p begin="01:39.710" end="01:44.260" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19"><span begin="01:39.710" end="01:40.300">I see</span> <span begin="01:40.350" end="01:41.780">right through you</span> <span begin="01:42.240" end="01:43.310">but what do I</span> <span begin="01:43.330" end="01:44.260">do</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我其实早就看透了你，可我又能怎么办？</span></p><p begin="01:44.730" end="01:49.400" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20"><span begin="01:44.730" end="01:45.800">Of course I fall</span> <span begin="01:45.870" end="01:46.730">for it</span><span begin="01:46.900" end="01:47.900">just like I did</span> <span begin="01:47.900" end="01:49.400">when I was sixteen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我当然还是会再次沦陷，就像十六岁那年一样</span></p><p begin="01:49.550" end="01:51.400" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21"><span begin="01:49.550" end="01:49.990">Such a</span> <span begin="01:50.140" end="01:51.400">fool for you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">为了你，我真像个傻子</span></p><p begin="01:51.850" end="01:54.130" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22"><span begin="01:51.850" end="01:52.360">Did you</span> <span begin="01:52.360" end="01:53.380">ever even</span> <span begin="01:53.380" end="01:54.130">miss me</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="01:54.200" end="01:54.740"><span begin="01:54.200" end="01:54.740">(Doubt it)</span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你真的有想念过我吗？我很怀疑</span></p><p begin="01:54.740" end="01:56.800" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23"><span begin="01:54.740" end="01:55.420">Kali Ma</span> <span begin="01:55.430" end="01:55.790">lean</span> <span begin="01:55.850" end="01:56.800">over me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">迦梨女神，俯身靠近我吧</span></p><p begin="01:57.150" end="01:59.260" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24"><span begin="01:57.150" end="01:57.860">Rip your hand</span> <span begin="01:57.860" end="01:59.260">into my chest</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">把手伸进我的胸膛</span></p><p begin="01:59.300" end="02:01.850" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25"><span begin="01:59.300" end="01:59.880">Pull out my</span> <span begin="01:59.900" end="02:00.760">beating heart</span> <span begin="02:00.790" end="02:01.290">for the world</span> <span begin="02:01.300" end="02:01.850">to see</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">将我跳动的心脏掏出来给全世界看</span></p><p begin="02:01.950" end="02:03.630" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26"><span begin="02:01.950" end="02:02.770">Then send me</span> <span begin="02:02.830" end="02:03.630">down to hell</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">然后把我送下地狱</span></p><p begin="02:03.680" end="02:05.550" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27"><span begin="02:03.680" end="02:04.520">You ignore</span> <span begin="02:04.590" end="02:05.550">my pleas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你无视我的哀求</span></p><p begin="02:05.930" end="02:08.100" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28"><span begin="02:05.930" end="02:06.890">Indiana</span> <span begin="02:06.960" end="02:07.350">couldn't</span> <span begin="02:07.350" end="02:08.100">save me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">连印第安纳都救不了我</span></p><p begin="02:08.130" end="02:13.000" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29"><span begin="02:08.130" end="02:09.450">So I guess</span> <span begin="02:09.450" end="02:10.500">I'll save</span> <span begin="02:10.550" end="02:13.000">myself</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">所以我只能自己救自己</span></p><p begin="02:13.450" end="02:15.500" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30"><span begin="02:13.450" end="02:14.100">Kali Ma</span> <span begin="02:14.200" end="02:15.500">lean over me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">迦梨女神，俯身靠近我吧</span></p><p begin="02:15.900" end="02:18.020" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31"><span begin="02:15.900" end="02:16.590">Rip your hand</span> <span begin="02:16.590" end="02:17.150">into</span> <span begin="02:17.150" end="02:18.020">my chest</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">把手伸进我的胸膛</span></p><p begin="02:18.100" end="02:20.650" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32"><span begin="02:18.100" end="02:18.570">Pull out my</span> <span begin="02:18.600" end="02:19.500">beating heart</span> <span begin="02:19.520" end="02:20.650">for the world to see</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">将我仍在跳动的心脏掏出来给全世界看</span></p><p begin="02:20.800" end="02:24.400" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33"><span begin="02:20.800" end="02:21.670">Oh won't you</span> <span begin="02:21.720" end="02:22.850">go to</span> <span begin="02:22.900" end="02:24.400">hell</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="02:26.990" end="02:27.990"><span begin="02:26.990" end="02:27.990">(Go to hell)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">下地狱吧！</span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">哦，你怎么不干脆下地狱？</span></p><p begin="02:32.700" end="02:37.510" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L34"><span begin="02:32.700" end="02:33.230">You're gonna</span> <span begin="02:33.300" end="02:33.980">get killed</span> <span begin="02:34.000" end="02:34.990">chasing after</span> <span begin="02:35.000" end="02:35.680">your damn</span> <span begin="02:35.790" end="02:37.510">fortune and glory</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你迟早会为了追逐你那该死的荣耀和名利而送命</span></p><p begin="02:37.550" end="02:40.350" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35"><span begin="02:37.550" end="02:38.420">Maybe I</span> <span begin="02:38.630" end="02:38.900">maybe</span> <span begin="02:38.930" end="02:40.350">I will</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">也许吧，也许我会</span></p><p begin="02:40.730" end="02:42.450" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36"><span begin="02:40.730" end="02:41.200">but not</span> <span begin="02:41.230" end="02:42.450">today</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">但不是今天！</span></p></div></body></tt>